== Effects ==
* +1 [[damage]].
* Isaac's tears become red.

== Synergies ==
* {{I|Abyss}}: When Isaac uses Abyss to absorb Blood of the Martyr, it turns into a red locust dealing double Isaac’s damage per tick.
* {{i|The Book of Belial}} / {{p|XV - The Devil}}: Applies an additional 1.5× damage multiplier.
** The ×1.5 damage multiplier does not stack with the ×1.5 damage multiplier from {{i|Magic Mushroom}} and {{i|Cricket's Head}}.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Blood of the Martyr}}: No further effect when multiple copies of the item are acquired.

